# A full 60-second check-in sitting for a new patient, from the check-in screen to the summary
# and back. The simulator build measures a generated signal, not the camera.
tap "Check in a new patient"
wait "Use face match for re-checks?"
shot consent
tap "No, use my name"
wait "Start sitting" 60
shot sitting-framing
tap "Start sitting"
wait "End sitting now"
sleep 25
shot sitting-running
wait "Sitting summary" 120
wait "Baseline saved" 60
shot summary
scroll down
shot summary-lower
tap "Next patient"
wait "Re-check"
